  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Techrun 2025-AI Digital and Sports Forum</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to position Kenya&#x2014;particularly Eldoret&#x2014;as a leading African hub for AI-driven digital innovation by integrating technology, investment, youth skills development, and sports through the TechRun 2025 Forum. It aims to connect startups with investors, policymakers, and global partners while expanding youth access to AI and digital skills. By strengthening UK&#x2013;Kenya collaboration on ethical AI, innovation capacity, and inclusive economic growth, the project will foster a sustainable pipeline of skilled youth, scalable startups, and long-term multi-stakeholder partnerships.</narrative>
  </description>
